{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-05-04 10:07:00', 'title': 'LILLY PLANS DONATION OF COVID-19 THERAPIES TO DIRECT RELIEF FOR USE IN LOW- AND LOWER-MIDDLE-INCOME COUNTRIES', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) IS DONATING COVID-19 THERAPIES TO DIRECT RELIEF, ENABLING THE HUMANITARIAN ORGANIZATION TO PROVIDE COVID-19 THERAPIES AT NO COST TO LOW- AND LOWER-MIDDLE-INCOME COUNTRIES MOST HEAVILY IMPACTED BY THE PANDEMIC. THIS DONATION FURTHERS BOTH LILLY AND DIRECT RELIEF'S CHARITABLE GOAL OF PROVIDING ACCESS TO COVID-19 TREATMENTS TO PATIENTS IN NEED BY PROVIDING THESE MEDICINES FREE OF CHARGE TO LOW- AND LOWER-MIDDLE-INCOME COUNTRIES."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-05-04 07:00:00', 'title': 'LILLY OUTLINES ROBUST PLANS TO STRENGTHEN ESG COMMITMENTS ACROSS THE GLOBE', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) WILL OUTLINE ITS NEWLY UPDATED ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) STRATEGY, HIGHLIGHTING ITS COMMITMENTS IN KEY AREAS DURING THE COMPANY'S SUSTAINABILITY WEBCAST TODAY AT 10:30 AM ET. IN ADDITION, LILLY HAS LAUNCHED A NEW COMPREHENSIVE RESOURCE TO PROVIDE TRANSPARENCY AROUND THE COMPANY'S ESG GOALS AND PROGRESS AT ESG.LILLY.COM."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-05-04 06:42:00', 'title': "LILLY ACCELERATING BARICITINIB'S AVAILABILITY IN INDIA FOLLOWING RECEIPT OF PERMISSION FOR RESTRICTED EMERGENCY USE AS A COVID-19 THERAPY VIA DONATIONS AND LICENSING AGREEMENTS", 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) ANNOUNCES NEW INITIATIVES TO HELP COVID-19 PATIENTS IN INDIA AS PART OF ITS COMMITMENT TO BRING THE FULL FORCE OF ITS SCIENTIFIC AND MEDICAL EXPERTISE TO ATTACK THE CORONAVIRUS PANDEMIC AROUND THE WORLD. LILLY IS OFFERING DONATIONS OF BARICITINIB TO THE INDIAN GOVERNMENT THROUGH DIRECT RELIEF WHILE SIMULTANEOUSLY WORKING WITH LOCAL INDIAN PHARMACEUTICAL COMPANIES TO EXECUTE ROYALTY-FREE VOLUNTARY LICENSING AGREEMENTS TO